{"unit_id":"AIFireForAll__dsh-enter-lock#feature-1","repo":"AIFireForAll/dsh-enter-lock","commit":"2c7dfa10f6d97ce99acb9bc52bcdcbafc216839d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-lock 的功能「锁定 Enter 提交」：点击输入框旁的锁形按钮切换状态。锁定时普通 Enter 不会提交当前草稿，仍可继续编辑。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:114-136","src/client.js:268-286"]}
{"unit_id":"AIFireForAll__dsh-enter-lock#feature-2","repo":"AIFireForAll/dsh-enter-lock","commit":"2c7dfa10f6d97ce99acb9bc52bcdcbafc216839d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-lock 的功能「快捷键切换」：焦点位于聊天输入框时按 Ctrl+Shift+K 或 Cmd+Shift+K 切换当前会话的发送锁；输入法组合期间及按键重复时不触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:182-209","src/client.js:251-265"]}
{"unit_id":"AIFireForAll__dsh-enter-lock#feature-3","repo":"AIFireForAll/dsh-enter-lock","commit":"2c7dfa10f6d97ce99acb9bc52bcdcbafc216839d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-lock 的功能「按会话隔离锁状态」：锁定标志按会话 ID 单独记录，切换会话不会共用状态；该状态保存在浏览器内存中，刷新后清除。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:34-64","src/client.js:294-303"]}
