{"unit_id":"AIFireForAll__dsh-enter-lock#caveat-1","repo":"AIFireForAll/dsh-enter-lock","commit":"2c7dfa10f6d97ce99acb9bc52bcdcbafc216839d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-lock 的使用须知：锁状态只保存在浏览器内存，刷新页面或重启 DSH 后会清除；锁只阻止键盘 Enter 提交，点击官方发送按钮仍会发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:34-38","src/client.js:268-286"]}
